Package: fastdoc
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libicu78 | libicu77 | libicu76 | libicu75 | libicu74 | libicu73 | libicu72 | libicu71 | libicu70 | libicu67 | libicu66 | libicu63
Recommends: xdg-utils, shared-mime-info, desktop-file-utils, libssl3 | libssl3t64 | libssl1.1
Section: text
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ww-w-ai/fast-document-reader
Description: Fast, read-only document reader
 FastDoc opens Markdown, plain text, Word (.docx, .docm, .dotx, .dotm),
 OpenDocument (.odt) and Hangul (.hwp, .hwpx) documents, and exports them to
 PDF. Korean text renders without any system font: a Noto Sans KR subset is
 bundled. The build is self-contained and carries its own .NET runtime.
